# BLE 连接状态 Provider 调查报告

## 结论（先说答案）

**最干净、最权威的连接信号源是 `bleSessionProvider`**（`packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/service/ble_session_controller.dart`）。它是跨 Feature 共享的 `NotifierProvider`，非 autoDispose，状态类型为 `BleSessionState`，其中 `isConnected` 是 transport 已连接的布尔快照。

仓库里**没有**对外暴露的「每连接一次就 emit 一次」的 Riverpod `StreamProvider<bool>`。现有 side-effect 模式都是在 Notifier/Widget 的 `build()` 里用 **`ref.listen` 检测 `false → true` 过渡**（例如 `DeviceIdentitySyncController` 触发 `identity_sync_started`）。

---

## 1. `core_ble` / `common_ble_protocol` 中的连接状态 Provider

### 核心：`bleSessionProvider`（首选）

**文件：** `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/service/ble_session_controller.dart`

```12:15:packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/service/ble_session_controller.dart
final bleSessionProvider =
    NotifierProvider<BleSessionController, BleSessionState>(
      BleSessionController.new,
    );
```

**状态模型：** `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/model/ble_session_state.dart`

```4:30:packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/model/ble_session_state.dart
class BleSessionState {
  const BleSessionState({
    this.connectionState = BleConnectionState.disconnected,
    this.deviceId,
    this.hardwareAddress,
    this.deviceName,
    this.lastError,
  });

  final BleConnectionState connectionState;
  // ...
  bool get isConnected => connectionState == BleConnectionState.connected;
```

**枚举：** `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/model/ble_models.dart`

```45:57:packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/model/ble_models.dart
enum BleConnectionState {
  disconnected,
  connecting,
  connected,
  disconnecting,
}
```

**内部机制（非 Riverpod 暴露）：** `BleSessionController.build()` 订阅原生 `BleConnectionEventSource.connectionEvents`（或 fallback 到 `ble.connectionState`），更新 `BleSessionState`。这是底层 stream，但**没有**包装成 public `StreamProvider`。

```35:50:packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/service/ble_session_controller.dart
    final ble = ref.read(bleServiceProvider);
    final events = ble is BleConnectionEventSource
        ? (ble as BleConnectionEventSource).connectionEvents
        : ble.connectionState.map((state) => BleConnectionEvent(state: state));
    _connectionSubscription = events.listen((event) {
      if (event.state == BleConnectionState.disconnected) {
        _resetSession();
      }
      state = state.copyWith(
        connectionState: event.state,
        deviceId: event.deviceId,
        hardwareAddress: event.hardwareAddress,
        // ...
      );
    });
```

**常用 select 写法（仓库内多处使用）：**
```dart
ref.watch(bleSessionProvider.select((s) => s.isConnected))  // bool
ref.listen<BleSessionState>(bleSessionProvider, ...)         // 完整状态过渡
```

---

### `common_ble_protocol` 层

| Provider | 类型 | 文件 | 连接相关 |
|---|---|---|---|
| `glassesDeviceStateProvider` | `NotifierProvider<GlassesDeviceStateNotifier, GlassesDeviceState>` | `packages/common/common_ble_protocol/lib/src/model/glasses_device_state.dart` | 聚合 `bleSessionProvider.isConnected` + 设备 notify 事件（佩戴/电量） |
| `glassesDeviceEventsProvider` | `StreamProvider<GlassesEvent>` | `packages/common/common_ble_protocol/lib/src/provider/glasses_device_events_provider.dart` | **不是**连接事件流；是协议帧事件，连接后才开始订阅 raw notifications |
| `glassesMediaFileCountProvider` | `NotifierProvider<..., GlassesMediaFileCountState>` | `packages/common/common_ble_protocol/lib/src/provider/glasses_media_file_count_provider.dart` | 在 `build()` 里 `ref.listen` 连接状态，连接时触发 `refresh()` |

**`glassesDeviceStateProvider` 签名：**

```66:69:packages/common/common_ble_protocol/lib/src/model/glasses_device_state.dart
final glassesDeviceStateProvider =
    NotifierProvider<GlassesDeviceStateNotifier, GlassesDeviceState>(
      GlassesDeviceStateNotifier.new,
    );
```

其 `GlassesDeviceState.isConnected` 直接来自 `bleSessionProvider`，不是独立信号源：

```80:93:packages/common/common_ble_protocol/lib/src/model/glasses_device_state.dart
  GlassesDeviceState build() {
    final session = ref.watch(bleSessionProvider);

    if (!session.isConnected) {
      // ...
      return GlassesDeviceState(
        isConnected: false,
        deviceId: session.deviceId,
        deviceName: session.deviceName,
      );
    }
```

**`glassesDeviceEventsProvider` 签名：**

```15:26:packages/common/common_ble_protocol/lib/src/provider/glasses_device_events_provider.dart
final glassesDeviceEventsProvider = StreamProvider<GlassesEvent>((ref) async* {
  final logger = ref.read(appLoggerProvider);
  final session = ref.watch(bleSessionProvider);
  if (!session.isConnected) {
    logger.log(/* ... */ 'protocol_subscription_skipped', /* reason: transport_disconnected */);
    return;
  }
  // ... yield GlassesEvent (protocol_event_received 等)
```

**注意：** 这是 `protocol_event_received` 的来源，**不是**「设备已连接」的一次性事件。

