## 2. `AppLlmController` 的 `preflight BLE connected=true` 检查

**文件：** `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/ai/feature_app_llm/lib/src/controller/app_llm_controller.dart`

Preflight 用的是 **`ref.read(bleSessionProvider)` 一次性快照**，不是 watch/listen：

```269:273:packages/feature/ai/feature_app_llm/lib/src/controller/app_llm_controller.dart
    final bleSession = ref.read(bleSessionProvider);
    _log(
      'preflight BLE connected=${bleSession.isConnected} '
      'deviceId=${_fieldState(bleSession.deviceId ?? '')}',
    );
```

同一 controller 的 `build()` 里还有连接**过渡**监听，但只处理断连（不触发 preflight）：

```155:159:packages/feature/ai/feature_app_llm/lib/src/controller/app_llm_controller.dart
    ref.listen<BleSessionState>(bleSessionProvider, (prev, next) {
      if ((prev?.isConnected ?? false) && !next.isConnected) {
        _log('BLE disconnected → continue phone-only session');
      }
    });
```

Wake 事件来自 `glassesDeviceEventsProvider`（`GlassesLlmWakeEvent`），与 preflight 的 connected 检查是两条独立路径。

---

## 3. 现有的「连接后触发 side effect」机制

**没有**独立的「device connected event stream」Riverpod provider。现有模式是 **`ref.listen` + 过渡检测**。

### 最佳范例：`DeviceIdentitySyncController`（对应 `identity_sync_started` 日志）

**文件：** `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_identity_sync_controller.dart`

**Provider：**
```675:678:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_identity_sync_controller.dart
final deviceIdentitySyncControllerProvider =
    NotifierProvider<DeviceIdentitySyncController, void>(
      DeviceIdentitySyncController.new,
    );
```

**连接过渡监听（`fireImmediately: true` 会在已连接时立即触发）：**

```56:62:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_identity_sync_controller.dart
    ref.listen<BleSessionState>(bleSessionProvider, (_, next) {
      if (next.isConnected && next.deviceId != null) {
        _startDeviceInfoWatch(next.deviceId!);
      } else {
        _cancelDeviceInfoWatch(reason: 'transport_disconnected');
      }
    }, fireImmediately: true);
```

**`_startDeviceInfoWatch` 打出 `identity_sync_started`：**

```448:458:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_identity_sync_controller.dart
    final session = ref.read(bleSessionProvider);
    _logger.log(
      AppLogLevel.debug,
      'ble',
      'identity_sync_started',
      context: {
        'deviceId': deviceId,
        'hardwareAddress': session.hardwareAddress ?? '',
        'transportConnected': '${session.isConnected}',
      },
    );
```

**生命周期保活：** `DeviceAutoConnectGate` 通过 `ref.watch(deviceIdentitySyncControllerProvider)` 保持 controller 常驻：

```242:244:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_auto_connect_controller.dart
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    ref.watch(deviceIdentitySyncControllerProvider);
```

**连接链路（`connect_step_transport_connect_completed`）：** `DeviceConnectController` 调用 `bleSessionProvider.notifier.connect()`，成功后 `bleSessionProvider.isConnected` 变为 true，上述 listener 随之触发：

```140:165:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_connect_controller.dart
    _logger.log(AppLogLevel.debug, 'ble', 'connect_step_transport_connect_started');
    final result = await ref
        .read(bleSessionProvider.notifier)
        .connect(deviceId: deviceId, deviceName: deviceName);
    // ...
    _logger.log(AppLogLevel.debug, 'ble', 'connect_step_transport_connect_completed', /* ... */);
    if (result case Success()) {
      final session = ref.read(bleSessionProvider);
      // recordConnected + start handshake ...
```

`DeviceConnectSource.autoConnect` 来自 `DeviceAutoConnectController` / `DeviceForegroundReconnectController`，最终都走同一条 `connect()` 路径。

### 其他 side-effect 范例

**`GlassesMediaFileCountController`（连接 → 刷新媒体数）：**

```23:31:packages/common/common_ble_protocol/lib/src/provider/glasses_media_file_count_provider.dart
    ref.listen<bool>(
      bleSessionProvider.select((session) => session.isConnected),
      (_, connected) {
        if (!connected) {
          state = const GlassesMediaFileCountState();
          return;
        }
        unawaited(refresh());
      },
    );
```

**`CallRecordController`（重连 → 重新 check support）：**

```38:49:packages/feature/device/feature_device_record/lib/src/controller/call_record_controller.dart
    ref.listen<bool>(bleSessionProvider.select((s) => s.isConnected), (
      previous,
      connected,
    ) {
      if (previous == true && connected == false) {
        // reset
      } else if (previous == false && connected == true) {
        unawaited(_checkSupport());
      }
    });
```

**UI 层过渡检测（`previous != true && connected`）：**

```47:58:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/pages/device_connect_page.dart
    ref.listen<bool>(bleSessionProvider.select((s) => s.isConnected), (
      previous,
      connected,
    ) {
      if (connected && previous != true && context.mounted) {
        // navigate away on connect
      }
    });
```

